B.akP=s(["Ledger entries support TWD, USD, JPY, and other currencies with separate totals to avoid mixed-currency calculations.","Manual helper entry now guides typed or voice input one field at a time.","The first signed-in view loads dashboard and helper artwork first; remaining artwork loads in the background, with Tab and Enter support on desktop."],t.s)
